    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/5a0e3d677bb765ee8f7e315b6635daeb.avif?t=1744877660\" /></span><br><br><strong>Stick to the Plan</strong> is a cozy and soothing puzzle game that takes you on a journey with Roberto, as he embarks on a quest to get the perfect stick along the way.<br><br>The game is simple: avoid obstacles and chart a path towards the goal. But beware, it's not as easy as it appears. And don't forget to grab your stick!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/0b621e64225223210c9416680655f5b7.avif?t=1744877660\" /></span><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/2602410279983018ae3b3481fc2df08f.avif?t=1744877660\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Intuitive and accessible controls:</strong> move, rotate, pick up &amp; drop your stick in order to solve puzzles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/15186836092492cc39d5cbbe0898c81a.poster.avif?t=1744877660\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/15186836092492cc39d5cbbe0898c81a.webm?t=1744877660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/15186836092492cc39d5cbbe0898c81a.mp4?t=1744877660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Solve about <strong>70 precious levels</strong>, each one with its own set of challenges and surprises.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/cd10ae8dd691e6330383d4e215e60ead.poster.avif?t=1744877660\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/cd10ae8dd691e6330383d4e215e60ead.webm?t=1744877660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/cd10ae8dd691e6330383d4e215e60ead.mp4?t=1744877660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Immerse yourself in <strong>beautiful 3D worlds</strong> that have been crafted focusing on detail and enjoy an environmental <strong>OST that enhances the experience</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/c1fecdfb65049bcd3c36cbf8a6658921.poster.avif?t=1744877660\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/c1fecdfb65049bcd3c36cbf8a6658921.webm?t=1744877660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/c1fecdfb65049bcd3c36cbf8a6658921.mp4?t=1744877660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Accesibility options like <strong>outlines for Roberto and the sticks</strong>, so everyone can play!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/eaa50d215eff9c3c5fa48627754cfc93.poster.avif?t=1744877660\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/eaa50d215eff9c3c5fa48627754cfc93.webm?t=1744877660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/eaa50d215eff9c3c5fa48627754cfc93.mp4?t=1744877660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Enjoy the lovely <strong>hand-drawn</strong> menus and level selectors while you explore <strong>5 unique worlds</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/d4b10b094b7c199bce358a1ef1b6a61f.poster.avif?t=1744877660\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/d4b10b094b7c199bce358a1ef1b6a61f.webm?t=1744877660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/d4b10b094b7c199bce358a1ef1b6a61f.mp4?t=1744877660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><strong>Uncover the heartwarming story of Roberto</strong> through illustrated vignettes, and discover the reason behind his quest for the perfect stick.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/fd2964614635eb8c2d45b32341fe2274.poster.avif?t=1744877660\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/fd2964614635eb8c2d45b32341fe2274.webm?t=1744877660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334280/extras/fd2964614635eb8c2d45b32341fe2274.mp4?t=1744877660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul>",
